    23→ *   └─► complete()            — one-shot text completion (non-realtime)
    24→ *   └─► stream()              — streaming text completion (non-realtime)
    25→ *   └─► openSession()         — open a realtime WebSocket session
    26→ *   └─► shutdown()            — release the OpenAI client
    27→ * ```
